{"kind":"assert","text":"AE-1 ruling on 59c2e3cb: AE-1 returns a closed result. No second\nseam for ARC-1.\n\nReason: one `null` holds four causes today, and two of them never\nchange. A cause that never changes then retries without end, and no\nperson sees why. Ruling 59767cd8 already forbids that for a removed\ntrust row. The same rule holds for each cause. A second seam in ARC-1\nreads the same facts a second time, which 2bbd55aa forbids for a\nformula.\n\n1. `applicationArchiveProofBytes` answers the signed text or one\n   refusal from a closed list. The list has these four members, with\n   names in the style of the package: the installation is not active\n   yet, the retained proof is missing, the records pass the 64 KiB\n   metadata bound, the proof is malformed or unsupported.\n2. A refusal holds the reason only. It holds no text of the sender,\n   no payload and no label. Its size is fixed, and the charge of the\n   read does not change.\n3. The receiver retries a refusal only when a later event can change\n   the answer. \"Not active yet\" retries, as today. For each other\n   member, state in the note which later event changes the answer.\n   When no event does, the scope takes the named policy stop that\n   AE-1 already has, with the reason in its record. The stop keeps\n   the confirmed receipt and makes no provider call.\n4. A reply that the receiver cannot read keeps its answer of today.\n5. A person reads the reason where the stop of a removed trust row\n   shows today. Add no page and no command.\n\nARC-1 takes its facts from this result. Whether the metadata bound\nbecomes a cohort condition is a question for the ARC-1 number act.\nAE-1 does not use the name `entry-outside-archive-cohort`.\n\nNo cap changes. The read stays internal to the namespace, bounded\nand charged. Name the closed list in the review request under the\nfirst Security item.","body":{"stale_bases":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:59c2e3cb7c46680b186f97b48829e35e3feef3aa stale; retired bases: git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:b5750e6e82650d29470d64f83b0dc3a50115b466","to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}